> n

Dining room
A huge oval table occupies most of the room, rounded by twelve chairs. On the
walls you find more oil paintings, all depicting strange scenes. The rest of the
room is quite bare, as if there are some things missing, that once might have
been here. One exit leads south, back to the vestibule, and another leads north
to another room.

> n

Living room
The living room is a lushly decorated spacious room with a lounger in front of a
whole row of windows. Another dark oil painting is occupying most of the western
wall and opposite of it sits a fireplace. Above the mantelpiece hangs the
carcass of a ray and you spot an old phonograph on a low table. The only exit is
south, to the dining room.

> get matches
You take the matches off the mantelpiece.

> s

Dining room
A huge oval table occupies most of the room, rounded by twelve chairs. On the
