A dead kraken has been flushed ashore.

You are scared of the pounding.

> e
There doesn't appear to be an exit in that direction.

> x kraken
The kraken has a bulky head, sitting on top of a bunch of tentacles. He was
obviously wounded by some other animal, that's why a huge puddle of blood has
pooled under its body But what animal could cause such wounds? You shiver.

> inject syringe into kraken
With some effort, you get a small amount of blood into the syringe.

A torrent of water hits you directly into your face.

> w

Harbour
This is maybe the oldest part of the village and marks the beginning of any
human settlement on this forbidding stretch of land. The harbour administration
once might have been a proud building, but now it's crumbled and through its
foundations comes another structure to daylight, made of huge black blocks that
