(attempting to go south)
You step into the rain and feel the downpour of the raindrops on your raincoat.

Front yard
An old tree has grown in the middle of the front yard. The house looks worn but
noble and its facades show the craftsmanship of the past century. The front door
to the north is kind of a portal, flanked by two statues on either side. Once
